id = "gloamwood_stalker"
display_name = "Gloamwood Stalker"
description = "Something in the Gloomwood learned to keep still for hours under the moss, then finish the gap in four strides. It digs before it eats -- the settlers' iron rolls up around its denmaw, strip by strip, and whatever ore it swallowed stays swallowed. The deep grades too: mythril and star crush without grace in that gullet."
